HYP-2725 two-support-axis ledger for the LRC14 Weyl/origin error
Exact S69 factorial-support arithmetic; relation-support lesson from S9.

AXIS WARNING
  relation-support parity is not the proof rule:
    K(-n)=conj(K(n)), so reverse relation-pairs reinforce as 2 Re K(n).
  keep support-size as cut/cycle structure, not as odd/even cancellation.

